---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../lib/site';
---

<Layout
  title={`Returns Policy - ${SITE_NAME}`}
  description="Returns and refunds policy for personalized plastic allergy cards from Open Allergy Cards."
>
  <section class="section prose-page">
    <h2>Returns policy</h2>
    <p>
      Free downloads cannot be “returned.” You can recreate and re-download a card anytime at no
      cost.
    </p>
    <h3>Personalized physical cards</h3>
    <p>
      Plastic cards are made to order with your chosen allergen, language, and optional name. Because
      they are personalized, we generally cannot accept returns for change-of-mind after printing.
    </p>
    <h3>Defects and errors on our side</h3>
    <p>
      If a card arrives damaged, or we printed the wrong configuration due to our mistake, contact us
      with photos and your order details. We will make it right with a reprint or refund where
      appropriate.
    </p>
    <h3>Customer mistakes</h3>
    <p>
      If you notice a wrong allergen or language right after checkout, contact us immediately. Once
      production has started, changes may not be possible.
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
      <a href="/contact">Contact us</a> · <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
